---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — Allie Rays" description="Who I am, what I've built, and what I believe about Applied AI." fullWidth>
  <article class="about">
    <div class="about-layout">
      <div class="about-text">
        <h1>About</h1>

        <p>
          I'm Allie. I'm an Enterprise Solutions Architect with 15+ years translating technical concepts into business outcomes for enterprise and tech companies. I build with Claude, MCP, and the Anthropic Agent SDK daily.
        </p>

        <p>
          My background is in enterprise security and compliance (FedRAMP, SOC2, HIPAA), cloud architecture, and API integrations. I studied Applied Agentic AI at MIT. I've won four hackathons, including 1st place and Best Use Case at the Redis MCP AI Agents Hackathon, and a top 30 finish at Anthropic's Build with Claude.
        </p>

        <p>
          I believe anyone can build with AI now. It takes willingness and time to teach yourself how. The interesting work isn't asking a chatbot for a recipe. It's data manipulation, fuzzy queries, automations, agents that look at a situation and decide what to do next. That's what I build and what I write about here.
        </p>

        <h2>Get in touch</h2>

        <div class="links">
          <a class="action-btn" href="https://linkedin.com/in/allierays" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 01-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 112.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
            LinkedIn
          </a>
          <a class="action-btn" href="https://x.com/allierays" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
            X
          </a>
          <a class="action-btn" href="https://github.com/allierays" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0C5.374 0 0 5.373 0 12c0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23A11.509 11.509 0 0112 5.803c1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576C20.566 21.797 24 17.3 24 12c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/></svg>
            GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-image">
        <img src="/images/allie-about.png" alt="Allie at a conference, looking out a window over the city" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 2rem auto 0;
  }

  .about-layout {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .about-text {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .about-image {
    flex: 0 0 420px;
  }

  .about-image img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about-text h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a5f 0%, #0891b2 50%, #14b8a6 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-text p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--ink-light);
  }

  .about-text h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .links a {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .links a:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-layout {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .about-image {
      flex: none;
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
